            "notes": "The deck focuses on aggressive gameplay with a mix of black and red cards, utilizing the two partner commanders, Ellie, Brick Master and Ellie, Vengeful Hunter, to deal damage quickly and efficiently. It includes a variety of low-cost creatures and spells to maintain pressure on the opponent, while also including powerful removal and disruption spells like Lightning Bolt, Fatal Push, and Thoughtseize to control the board. The deck also includes cards like Bloodsoaked Champion and Gravecrawler that can be recurred from the graveyard multiple times, ensuring a steady stream of threats. Overall, the deck aims to overwhelm opponents with a fast and relentless assault, taking advantage of the partner commanders' abilities to close out games swiftly."
